### 3. [.env](file:///c:/NovaAutomata_Internship/VoiceAgent_Pipecat/.env) + [.env.example](file:///c:/NovaAutomata_Internship/VoiceAgent_Pipecat/.env.example) — System Prompt

Updated `SYSTEM_PROMPT` to enforce short opening sentence with period:
```
"You are a helpful and friendly voice assistant. Always start your response 
with a short, clear sentence that ends with a period. After that first sentence, 
you may elaborate naturally with more detail and personality..."
```

**Why:** Cerebras generates 1800+ tok/sec → 10-word sentence in <10ms → first period triggers SENTENCE-mode flush → Cartesia starts synthesis within ~150ms of user finishing speaking.

